{
  "slug": "supabase",
  "name": "Supabase",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Supabase MCP integration for database operations, authentication, storage, and real-time subscriptions. Manage your Supabase projects, run SQL queries, and interact with your backend directly.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **6 agents** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `supabase` (Use when doing ANY task involving Supabase), `supabase-postgres-best-practices` (Postgres best practices maintained by Supabase, for Postgres running anywhere)\n- **Agents** (6): `claude`, `codex`, `copilot`, `cursor`, `grok`, `open-plugin`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `supabase`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install supabase@claude-plugins-official` from `supabase-community/supabase-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
